    "updated_at": "2017-01-21T03:03:57Z",
    "body": "Edge and Firefox appear not to implement `labels`. So it sounds like we should change this to match the two that implement. That means changing the property to nullable I guess. And removing `[SameObject]`, since if the element's type changes from hidden to something else or vice-versa its labels collection should change? Maybe that needs some more tests.",
